menu "tinyaisense Kinds"

    config TAS_SPEAKER_VOLUME
        int "Speaker volume at boot"
        range 0 100
        default 80
        help
            Each speaker's volume until the hub sets one with set_volume, on its log curve: 0
            mutes, 1 is -40 dB and 100 is 0 dB. The device never stores the hub's volume. Keep
            it the same as the Simulator's default_volume.

    config TAS_SPEAKERS_MAX
        int "Speakers a Board may have"
        range 1 4
        default 1
        help
            Each speaker's playout holds about 8 KB of static buffers.

    config TAS_TEST_HOOKS
        bool "Test hooks"
        default n
        help
            Debug builds only: console commands that drive the Kinds for tests by hand and in
            the loop, e.g. a test tone and its cut, with the firmware's own timing of them.

endmenu
